hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2669","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar Bundar, narrated to us Muhammad ibn Ja'far, narrated to us Shu'bah who said: I heard Qatadah narrating from Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib, from 'Aishah (RA), from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\n\Five are to be killed even in the state of Ihram (sacredness) and outside it: the snake"," the speckled crow"," the mouse"," the rabid dog"," and the kite.\""\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""
